<h3><u>Jaag sakina jaag</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><div><strong>Jaag sakina jaag</strong></div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Lo Hogayi rihaayi, lo kafela chalaa,</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Sar jab har ek shahid ka, sajaad ko mila</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(tab markade sakina) x2 pe sajaad ne kahaa</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Jaag Sakina jaag baba ka sar aaya) x3</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Baba tumhara aya) x2</div>

<div>Gaya waqt nind ka</div>

<div>Jaag..</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Sine pe sonewali (matti pe sogayi) x2</div>

<div>Baba ko rote rote (jo khamosh ho gayi) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Roro ke maan kabre) x2 Sakina pe ye kaha</div>

<div>Jaag</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Bibi karo salaam (adab ka makaam hai) x2</div>

<div>Bibi tere Sarhana shahe (tishna kaam hai) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Ay jaan jaldi badlo) x2 Ye kurta phata huwa</div>

<div>Jaag</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Baba ko dund ti thi (sakina utho utho) x2</div>

<div>Raato ko jaag ti thi (Sakina utho utho) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Lo agaye hai baba) x2 Ay jaan jag ja</div>

<div>Jaag.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Baba ke paas sona (na sona zamin par) x2</div>

<div>Rakho labo ko lab par (Jabi ko jabin par) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(aada ki gurkiyo ka) x2 Zamaana guzar gaya</div>

<div>Jaag.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Payghaam roz deti (the amu ke naam tum) x2</div>

<div>Roti thi yaad kar ke (une subh shaam tum) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Jaago ko jaa rahe hai) x2 Jaha sote hai chacha</div>

<div>Jaag</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Kistarha soyi baali (sakina na puchiye) x2</div>

<div>Ranjo alam se pathta (hai sina na puchiye) x2</div>

<div>Jaag..</div>
</p>